Savant-4B preview r3
Copyright (c) 2026 the Polyformer authors.

This model is a modified derivative of Qwen3-4B (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-4B, revision
1cfa9a7208912126459214e8b04321603b3df60c) by the Qwen team, Alibaba Cloud. Qwen3-4B is
Copyright 2024 Alibaba Cloud and licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy of that license is included
in this repository as LICENSE-Qwen3.

The weights were modified as follows:
  - fine-tuned with a LoRA adapter (rank 64, alpha 128, on the q, k, v, o, gate, up and down projections of every
    layer) trained by the Polyformer authors: PROMPTBOX's final adapter (stage 2g, the stage 2r language repair and
    60 iterations of reinforcement learning), continued for 500 steps on certified addition (ARITH, seed 1);
  - the adapter was merged into the base weights in bfloat16;
  - the merged model was converted to ONNX and its projection weights were quantised (MatMulNBits, block size 32,
    symmetric): 4 bits for the q, k, o, gate and up projections, 8 bits for the v and down projections; activations,
    the embedding and the output head are in float16.

The tokenizer files are the Qwen3-4B tokenizer, unmodified.
